# The spec of this round (scripts/gizmo-perf/gizmo-perf.spec.py) run against the runners of ca66012 (ca66012a08e36fac92422c31caf60b9a879078b8, the PR head the round started from):
# `git archive` of that commit (the whole tree) into a temp directory OUTSIDE the worktree, the new spec copied over its old one,
# `git init` and ONE commit of it (the spec runs git against a real repository). Nothing was linked from the worktree, nothing was
# written in it, no checkout or worktree was created (`target/` does not exist there: no editor binary, no build is possible).
# Command, with that temp directory as cwd: PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python3 scripts/gizmo-perf/gizmo-perf.spec.py -v
# Python 3.14.3; git 2.50.1 (Apple Git-155); worktree HEAD when it ran: ca66012a08e36fac92422c31caf60b9a879078b8 (the parent of the code commit), with the round-8 changes not yet committed.
